sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente
    participant A as Atendente
    participant M as Mecanico
    participant API as API NestJS
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    C->>A: Chega com veiculo
    A->>API: POST /service-orders (customerId, vehicleId)
    API->>DB: INSERT service_order (status: RECEIVED)
    API-->>A: OS criada

    alt Servico simples (ex.: troca de pneu)
        A->>API: POST /service-orders/:id/estimates
        API->>DB: UPDATE status -> WAITING_APPROVAL
        API->>DB: INSERT estimate
        API-->>A: Orcamento gerado
    else Servico complexo (ex.: motor)
        A->>M: Encaminha para diagnostico
        M->>API: PATCH /service-orders/:id/diagnosis
        API->>DB: UPDATE status -> IN_DIAGNOSIS
        M->>API: POST /service-orders/:id/estimates
        API->>DB: UPDATE status -> WAITING_APPROVAL
        API->>DB: INSERT estimate
        API-->>M: Orcamento gerado
    end

    A->>C: Apresenta orcamento

    alt Cliente aprova
        C-->>A: Aprova orcamento
        A->>API: PATCH /estimates/:id/status (APPROVED)
        API->>DB: UPDATE estimate status -> APPROVED
        API->>DB: UPDATE status -> IN_EXECUTION
        API-->>A: Orcamento aprovado
        A->>API: PATCH /service-orders/:id/mechanic
        API->>DB: UPDATE mechanicId
        API-->>M: Servico atribuido
        M->>API: PATCH /service-orders/:id/finish
        API->>DB: UPDATE status -> FINISHED
        API-->>M: Servico finalizado
        A->>API: PATCH /service-orders/:id/deliver
        API->>DB: UPDATE status -> DELIVERED
        API-->>A: Veiculo liberado
        A->>C: Veiculo entregue
        A->>API: PATCH /service-orders/:id/close
        API->>DB: UPDATE status -> CLOSED
        API-->>A: OS fechada
    else Cliente rejeita
        C-->>A: Rejeita orcamento
        A->>API: PATCH /service-orders/:id/reject
        API->>DB: UPDATE status -> DELIVERED
        API-->>A: Veiculo liberado sem execucao
        A->>C: Veiculo entregue (sem servico)
        A->>API: PATCH /service-orders/:id/close
        API->>DB: UPDATE status -> CLOSED
        API-->>A: OS fechada
    end
